%% Proposed work item state machine (ADR 0005).
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Created
  Created --> InProgress: start work
  Created --> WaitingForParts: part not in stock
  WaitingForParts --> InProgress: parts arrived
  InProgress --> Done: finish work
  Created --> Cancelled
  WaitingForParts --> Cancelled
  InProgress --> Cancelled
  Done --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
